    "text": "A body is projected vertically upwards from the surface of earth with a velocity equal to one third of escape velocity. The maximum height attained by the body will be<br />(Take radius of earth <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
